 # Fix: The fallback logic in fetchLayerData is incorrect.
 # A non-2xx HTTP response does NOT throw an error in fetch(),
 # so the catch block only fires on network failures.
 # The portal fallback never triggers on 404/500 from /api/data/.
 #
 # Solution: Check response.ok FIRST, then try fallback if it fails.

--- Replace fetchLayerData (lines 58-89) ---

